              >
              <span class="leading-[1.42]">Mira Maeder</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-1">
              <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.015em] opacity-40"
                >Wissenschaftliche Begleitung</span
              >
              <span class="flex flex-col leading-[1.42]">
                <span>Prof. Audrey Vorburger (Uni Bern)</span>
                <span>Dr. Anna Mittelholz (ETH Zürich)</span>
                <span>Prof. Dr. Henner Busemann (ETH Zürich)</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-1">
              <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.015em] opacity-40"
                >Lichttechnik</span
              >
              <span class="flex flex-col leading-[1.42]">
                <span>Zora Brändle</span>
